Freshora is a AI food scanner app. It uses your phone camera to scan and analyse food.

Just take a photo of your food and Freshora will try to identify it and give you some basic information about what it can see. 

The app saves your history, so you can check them again later.

Freshora is made to be simple and easy to use, specially for people who just want a quick AI based food analysis for consumption.

Some Important note for using freshora:- It cannot tells you that if food is actually safe to eat. AI can make mistakes and it cant detect bacteria, toxins, or other harmful things from a normal photo.

So, basically you can scan the food and check the result and use your own desicion to consume it or not.
